      <activity id="75692ba5-b5a9-5d74-8167-960335104118" activityNameId="8f22a5ac-ffe1-5f80-9fe6-9a3f6252b6a3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, bus</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, bus
Material data are rough estimates based on expert estimates. For energy data, yearly energy consumption figures from service garages of Swiss transport companies is employed.;
UUID: 3302d213-c31e-3bbf-bb0a-db9222a62d1f
The inventory includes materials used for alteration parts and energy consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the early 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: Energy data, is based on a brief survey of public transport companies. Material data based on expert estimate and further assumption to determine the material consumption. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3302d213-c31e-3bbf-bb0a-db9222a62d1f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
